.TH PINTA-3.1.2 1 "19 Nov 2026" "Pinta 3.1.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pinta-3.1.2 \- image editor (Pinta 3.1.2 GTK 4.8 backport)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pinta-3.1.2
.RI [ FILE ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pinta-3.1.2
is an unofficial arm64 build of the Pinta 3.1.2 image editor, backported
to the GTK 4.8 and libadwaita 1.2 libraries shipped with Raspberry Pi OS
Bookworm (Debian 12).
.PP
The .NET 8 runtime is bundled with the application, so no separate .NET
installation is required.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I FILE
Open one or more image files at startup.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/pinta
Per-user configuration and settings.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/PintaProject/Pinta
